(https://github.com/Euro-Office/DesktopEditors), which is based on
ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors and DocumentServer, originally developed by
Ascensio System SIA (https://www.onlyoffice.com/).

The original source code is available at:
https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE
https://github.com/Euro-Office

